WEBVTT

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:34.050
The Nouvlesse are ignoring our human rights!

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:37.060
Let those who would have Earth for Earth's sake be gone from Aure!

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:40.350
Do not allow the same tyranny that happened when we were on Earth!

00:01:41.060 --> 00:01:42.730
They're so noisy.

00:01:42.730 --> 00:01:46.690
Yes. They appear to be using loudspeakers.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:50.740
F- forgive me! Continuing with the report...

00:01:50.740 --> 00:01:55.070
Enough! Let's hear these radical measures of yours.

00:01:55.070 --> 00:01:58.540
Right. As a result of our exports backing up due to sabotage,

00:01:58.540 --> 00:02:00.750
we find them to be economic terrorists, and will file suit.

00:02:00.750 --> 00:02:01.750
File suit?

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:06.580
Yes. With the Galactic Organization of Trade and Tariffs, GOTT.

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:13.220
Fine. But you do understand, we cannot have any trouble.

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:26.100
So this is the "Secret Flower Garden" everyone talks about?

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:29.110
Then, this is a suit filed by the government of Aure?

00:02:29.110 --> 00:02:32.410
Yes, but to be more precise, it comes not from the government,

00:02:32.410 --> 00:02:33.710
but from the administrative offices.

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:36.350
Aure does not have an independent government;

00:02:36.350 --> 00:02:37.720
it is a planet of the Nouvlesse.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.840
Planet of the Nouvlesse?

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:46.220
Certification complete. GOTT cruiser La Muse.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:49.390
Approach on course A307 for entry inspection.

00:02:49.390 --> 00:02:52.690
Code 3357212. That is all.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:57.740
They're going to put us through an entry inspection in this day and age!?

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:59.700
This is an infringement on our rights!

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:02.740
What's more, they're refusing entry to La Muse and Donnerschlag!?

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:05.410
There's no sense in hitting the door over this!

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:10.180
And I've always wanted to see you without a stitch on, <i>Éclair-san.</i>

00:03:14.090 --> 00:03:16.090
You'll never learn, will you?

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.850
It's against my nature to tell lies.

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.430
The blues are even deeper than on Aineias, or anywhere else!

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:29.100
It's like the Earth I've seen on TV!

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:33.710
Aure means "garden" in old Earth language.

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:38.610
This planet is thus a beautiful garden, created after the image of Earth.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.380
Incredible, incredible!

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:42.110
You're feeling better, aren't you?

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.740
It smells great! There are so many flowers!

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:08.740
We're going on in!

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:10.500
Ah, wait for me!

00:04:11.740 --> 00:04:14.410
Welcome to Aure, the Secret Flower Garden!

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.750
I am Assistant Director Mister.

00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:21.090
I trust you were not put off by the scrutiny of the entry inspection.

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:22.480
N- no...

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:28.760
I should have expected as much from GOTT.

00:04:28.760 --> 00:04:31.100
Their ES members are all so elegant.

00:04:31.100 --> 00:04:32.820
You're most kind.

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:39.370
As you know, Aure prides itself on its long history as a vacation planet.

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.710
Is that right?

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.710
Mm-hmm.

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.040
In contrast to other planetary states, everything from the gravity,

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:47.050
to the composition of the atmosphere, to the vegetation,

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:49.380
is reproduced here, just as it is on Earth.

00:04:49.380 --> 00:04:53.720
I suppose not having a severe winter season is our biggest drawback.

00:04:53.720 --> 00:04:58.390
Reproduced? Why go to that much teraforming to fine-tune it?

00:04:58.390 --> 00:05:00.060
That's obvious, is it not?

00:05:00.060 --> 00:05:03.460
It's because this planet is collectively owned by us Nouvlesse.

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.630
Ordinarily, even with teraforming,

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:12.070
you couldn't hope to create the perfect planet.

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:16.740
These people have more or less adapted themselves to this environment.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:19.480
But, unlike people on other planets,

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:22.410
the Nouvlesse are of original Earth stock.

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:27.420
That much I know. But they're so arrogant...

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:32.120
That's who the Nouvlesse, those who control the galaxy, are.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:38.690
The jewel plant is coming into view.

00:05:43.030 --> 00:05:47.530
Quiet, isn't it? Not even half the laborers have shown up.

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.380
It's the same everywhere.

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:53.280
Aure's jewelry is the finest in the galaxy,

00:05:53.280 --> 00:05:56.050
but with this tendency towards sabotage spreading all over the planet,

00:05:56.050 --> 00:05:59.050
our dealings with foreign powers are at a standstill.

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:01.950
I don't mean to interfere in your internal affairs,

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:04.720
but why not listen to what the citizens have to say?

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:10.930
The opinions of the citizens are of... Ah, but they are not citizens.

00:06:10.930 --> 00:06:11.730
They are laborers.

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:13.060
No, I just meant...

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:15.230
For many generations now, they have been laborers,

00:06:15.230 --> 00:06:19.070
bound under a perpetual lifetime employment contract.

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:21.200
They are not citizens.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.880
Let's hurry along.

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.870
We haven't yet been through even half of the scheduled inspection.

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:34.350
You called them laborers, but they didn't appear to be cyborgs.

00:06:34.350 --> 00:06:39.020
Of course not. There isn't a single cyborg on Aure.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:41.890
We do not use machines or androids.

00:06:41.890 --> 00:06:44.030
Everything is luxuriously handcrafted by humans.

00:06:44.030 --> 00:06:47.130
In particular, those who were at the plant we just visited

00:06:47.130 --> 00:06:49.070
are all chosen from among the virgins.

00:06:50.030 --> 00:06:52.700
My, my, there's a demonstration going on here.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:54.040
Build schools!

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:56.370
Allow us the freedom to relocate!

00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:59.380
You don't allow them to move!?

00:06:59.380 --> 00:07:00.980
Of course not.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:04.510
We would have to deal with those who say they wish to travel then...

00:07:05.720 --> 00:07:10.650
I know! It's a bit sudden, but I wonder if I could ask you to do a job for me?

00:07:12.060 --> 00:07:15.060
Assistant Manager, what are you asking me to do?

00:07:15.060 --> 00:07:18.060
I want to have you remove the demonstrators all on your own.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:19.400
You can't mean!

00:07:19.400 --> 00:07:21.670
The military police will be standing by,

00:07:21.670 --> 00:07:26.740
but I would like them to see the skills of a GOTT's ES member.

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:27.740
But...

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:32.010
It is the duty of the rulers to show their force, as well.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:35.010
How can one person rule over another?

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:38.350
This planet has its own procedures.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.620
And although they may be harsher on this planet,

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:43.020
the same is true throughout the galaxy.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.690
That's the reality of it.

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:48.690
Who do those Nouvlesse think they are?

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:51.500
Have you forgotten what our duty is?

00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:54.100
We are to support the immediate restoration of economic activities,

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:57.700
based on the suit filed by the Aure administrators.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:01.370
We <i>are</i> GOTT ES members.

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:08.050
And for one, ES members cannot go against the orders of the chief of GOTT.

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:09.240
That's right.

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.050
Everyone stop!

00:08:13.050 --> 00:08:14.390
Who is that!?

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.390
Doesn't look like the military police.

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.390
One of the administrators' dogs?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:22.020
Whoever she is, she can't do anything all alone! Let's keep moving forward!

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:32.100
For one, ES members cannot go against the orders of the chief of GOTT.

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:37.680
Please go back! I will not let you go any farther!

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:39.940
Pay no heed! Push your way through!

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:44.940
Please, go back!

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.850
Break through!

00:08:52.360 --> 00:08:53.360
What incredible power!

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:56.030
What is this girl, some kind of monster!?

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:59.030
Please, go back!

00:08:59.030 --> 00:09:02.370
You may have a cute face, but you're a cyborg or an android or something!

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:04.660
She's a puppet of the Nouvlesse!

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.110
Please!

00:09:14.050 --> 00:09:17.140
Go back... please...

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:31.360
I would have thought that an ES member would have carried out their duties

00:09:31.360 --> 00:09:33.330
with more elegance.

00:09:33.330 --> 00:09:35.700
I will be waiting for you at the administrative offices.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:37.670
A hotel has been arranged for you.

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:41.010
Once you have changed, come see me.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.130
About face!

00:09:53.350 --> 00:09:57.450
That was very elegant! You did well.

00:10:05.030 --> 00:10:08.120
Sir, how would you like some flowers?

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.500
Forgive us, okay?

00:10:22.380 --> 00:10:24.310
We're here as guests of the administrative...!

00:10:26.050 --> 00:10:30.420
It's okay. I'll wash up at the fountain in the park, or somewhere.

00:10:41.670 --> 00:10:43.330
Éclair!

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:45.000
Are you two all right?

00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.340
Kanoe!

00:10:46.340 --> 00:10:47.700
Brother!

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:00.350
Thank you for saving Kanoe.

00:11:00.350 --> 00:11:04.690
That's okay. But since I was so dirty, I got <i>Kanoe-chan</i> all dirty, too.

00:11:04.690 --> 00:11:07.690
That's okay! Kanoe is always dirty anyhow!

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:09.180
Brother!

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:19.370
I was startled before, but <i>Éclair-san,</i> you're very pretty!

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:20.130
Thanks!

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.640
Mm-hm, pretty!

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.310
Éclair...

00:11:55.410 --> 00:11:59.080
Oh? You looked after Yott and Kanoe?

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:02.750
It's nothing fancy, but eat as much as you like.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:06.080
Auntie, give them something a little better!

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.720
Don't be ridiculous!

00:12:07.720 --> 00:12:11.420
The food here may not be fancy, but everyone says it's delicious!

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:14.060
Is that right? So this is what "delicious" tastes like?

00:12:14.060 --> 00:12:15.090
First time I've heard of it.

00:12:15.090 --> 00:12:19.090
Anyone who says that isn't welcome to come into my place again!

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:25.440
Hey there, Bateau, come on in!

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:26.770
Y- you!

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:29.710
She's the one who drove us away from our demonstration earlier!

00:12:31.110 --> 00:12:33.040
- One of the administrators' dogs!? - A spy!?

00:12:33.040 --> 00:12:36.050
What the hell is she here for!?

00:12:36.050 --> 00:12:38.050
The administrators?

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:41.280
Have our plans been found out? This is bad.

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:46.050
I don't feed anything to dogs!

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:02.430
That's not right, is it, Éclair? You're not?

00:13:04.410 --> 00:13:09.110
That man is right. I'm from GOTT.

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:15.420
But I'm not here to spy...

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:17.760
Go away!

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:23.350
Please... go away... you bureaucrat...

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:39.040
There's a lot people here again today, huh?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:43.050
It's a reception for the monsters. They must be trying to show them off.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:46.720
The monsters... It's a sign of their uneasiness.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:48.720
What can two or three people do?

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:52.720
Those are ES members? They look like ordinary girls.

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.730
Their appearance is to fool their opponents.

00:13:55.730 --> 00:13:57.060
The real issue is what's on the inside.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:13:59.700
Did you hear? Just one of them

00:13:59.700 --> 00:14:01.070
is supposed to have overwhelmed an entire band of demonstrators.

00:14:01.070 --> 00:14:04.070
Those foolish youngsters, making a play at revolution!

00:14:04.070 --> 00:14:06.400
I wonder if this means curtains for them.

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:10.410
In any case, we would like to avoid any further trouble.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:14.640
I wish I could have had even a spoonful of that soup...

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:19.440
<i>Are the same things repeating themselves again?</i>

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:28.760
Men! Are we livestock!?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.090
No!!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.700
Men! Are we machines!?

00:14:32.700 --> 00:14:34.700
No!!

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:38.840
That's right! We are humans! Humans,

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:42.040
born to live, to work out our days, to bear children, to raise them!

00:14:42.040 --> 00:14:45.040
Damned if we're to be toys of the Nouvlesse!

00:14:45.040 --> 00:14:48.380
Our ancestors, dying of thirst, gasping for air,

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:49.950
and in desperate poverty,

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.050
entered into that detestable contact with the Nouvlesse!

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:55.720
A contract of perpetual lifetime employment!

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:58.860
Our ancestors had their lives saved by that contract.

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:01.730
But those were our mothers and fathers of how many generations ago!?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:07.400
We are grateful to the Nouvlesse! We hold them in great respect! As humans!

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:10.730
Yes, we are neither livestock, nor machines!

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:15.760
We are humans, who for 300 years, have well paid them what we were worth!

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.410
We will not be deprived any longer!

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:24.080
Of the goods that we produce with our own labor! Of our dignity!

00:15:24.080 --> 00:15:26.680
Nor of our lives!

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:33.650
Administrators, and their puppets, do your ears hear our words!?

00:15:36.690 --> 00:15:39.690
You see, Yott? Just as I said.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:49.040
Disperse, my good laborers!

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:52.710
What you are doing is a serious breach of contract.

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:54.380
- Up yours! - Get out of here, administrator!

00:15:54.380 --> 00:16:01.520
We have not been restricted from using forcible measures to disperse you!

00:16:01.520 --> 00:16:05.520
He doesn't care if he kills them... is what he's saying.

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:09.730
We will not be daunted by your threats! Even if we are to die here,

00:16:09.730 --> 00:16:13.400
the citizens will one day expel the Nouvlesse from Aure!

00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:15.160
You have been warned.

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:24.040
They shot them!

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:41.090
Stop it!!

00:16:43.030 --> 00:16:44.030
Éclair!

00:16:44.030 --> 00:16:49.700
They're still human! You have no right to rule over them!

00:16:49.700 --> 00:16:54.040
This will not do. You may be a GOTT ES member,

00:16:54.040 --> 00:16:57.040
but those who are not of the Nouvlesse are lacking in elegance.

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.780
You're saying that being able to kill people

00:16:58.780 --> 00:17:00.380
with such a calm look on your face is elegant!?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:01.710
What do we do? Withdraw?

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:03.050
Wait...

00:17:03.050 --> 00:17:06.720
You take whatever you want from others, without getting your own hands dirty!

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.390
What are you Nouvlesse!?

00:17:08.390 --> 00:17:09.720
You're nothing but a bunch of cowards,

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.390
too frightened to adapt yourself to the rest of the universe!

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:13.720
What are they guilty of!?

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:15.450
Éclair!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:20.420
Are you the chief of GOTT?

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:22.400
Stop that, you coward!

00:17:22.400 --> 00:17:27.070
You understand the situation, yes? What is the meaning of this ES member?

00:17:27.070 --> 00:17:28.410
Mister!

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:31.340
I'm terribly sorry, Assistant Director Mister.

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:33.340
Chief!

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:35.350
Don't do it, Éclair!

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:39.280
ES member Éclair, cease speaking such disrespectful things,

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:41.440
and apologize to the Assistant Director.

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:43.350
Chief...

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:48.360
For one, ES members cannot go against the orders of the chief of GOTT.

00:17:48.360 --> 00:17:49.690
They shot them!

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:52.180
Here! You splash it on me, too!

00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:55.030
Let me out of here!

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:57.030
You have been warned.

00:17:57.030 --> 00:18:00.370
Hands up! Fists closed tightly!

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:01.710
What's the matter, Éclair?

00:18:01.710 --> 00:18:03.170
Éclair!

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:07.710
- Éclair? - Éclair!

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:25.720
W- what is this!?

00:18:28.730 --> 00:18:29.730
You monster!

00:18:29.730 --> 00:18:31.340
Stop it, Éclair!

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:34.840
That's right. You are the same as the rest of us.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:37.340
All you can do is repeat the same fate.

00:18:37.340 --> 00:18:40.110
You are in violation of orders!

00:18:41.010 --> 00:18:43.380
Stand down, Éclair!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:48.690
Anyone who wants to shoot them will have to take aim at me first!

00:18:48.690 --> 00:18:52.020
However, I will not be shot at for nothing, so prepare yourselves!

00:18:52.020 --> 00:18:53.490
Éclair!

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:00.130
Death to those who defy the Nouvlesse!

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:29.390
Lumiere!

00:19:29.390 --> 00:19:33.230
We're partners, aren't we?

00:19:39.340 --> 00:19:40.340
Hey!

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:41.340
I know.

00:19:41.340 --> 00:19:45.680
Plan C-5! Let the entire continent rise up!

00:19:45.680 --> 00:19:47.470
In revolution!

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:08.030
Things have become troublesome.

00:20:08.030 --> 00:20:11.030
l- I'm terribly sorry.

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:17.130
The Nouvlesse have decided to give up... both Aure, and you.

00:20:22.050 --> 00:20:25.380
There's nothing like disposing of one's troubles.

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:28.350
Troubles... we can't have any troubles...

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:42.000
A bloodless revolution, huh?

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:45.700
Unless they invest their finances, and continue with their teraforming,

00:20:45.700 --> 00:20:47.360
this planet will not last long.

00:20:48.670 --> 00:20:50.870
An era of winter will come.

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:55.480
This is an official notice

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:58.020
from the head office of the government of the Global Union.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:02.350
Mister Secretary, are you saying that this is the consensus of the Nouvlesse?

00:21:02.350 --> 00:21:05.820
Superintendent General, to repeat, this is an official notice

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:09.020
from the head office of the government of the Global Union.

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:13.030
What are you laughing at, Chief?

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:16.600
Excuse me. I was thinking about how the galaxy's great Nouvlesse

00:21:16.600 --> 00:21:20.700
were getting upset over a little girl or two...

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:22.710
Éclair and Lumiere?

00:21:22.710 --> 00:21:25.040
Expelled as ES members!?

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:27.380
Their registrations stricken...

00:21:27.380 --> 00:21:31.280
In other words... they're being purged.
